✨ 4. Clean Code Practices

A. Naming Conventions

Use meaningful names:
✅ getUserById() ❌ gubid()

Classes → PascalCase, variables/functions → camelCase

B. Small Functions

Each function should do one thing.

C. Comments & Documentation

Add comments for why, not what (code should be self-explanatory).

D. Avoid Repetition (DRY Principle)

Don’t Repeat Yourself — reuse functions.

E. Consistent Formatting

Follow consistent indentation and spacing.

F. Use Linters & Formatters

Tools: ESLint, Prettier

G. Error Handling

Always handle exceptions gracefully.